<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Static Web Page</title>
    <style>
        /* Base styles for a clean, modern look */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background: #34495e;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px 0;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        button {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #fff;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Static Website</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>About This Page</h2>
        <p>This is a lightweight, responsive static web page built using plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Because it is static, it serves pre-built files directly to your browser without any server-side processing, making it incredibly fast and secure.</p>
        
        <button id="alertBtn">Click Me!</button>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Static Site</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Simple client-side interactivity
        document.getElementById('alertBtn').addEventListener('click', function() {
            alert('Hello! This is a simple interactive element running entirely in your browser.');
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
